兰卡的 Web hosting company ，嗯。。</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18093845\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/8597/43c7/808002_normal.png?m=1789114171\" alt=\"shuijingwanwqyy\" data-uid=\"808002\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>6</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/shuijingwanwqyy\">shuijingwanwqyy</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-16 21:58:48 +08:00\">20h 20m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>既然这么垃圾，为什么还是要买了。租一个更有保障的、价格略微贵些的不行么？我用的 ZgoCloud 就感觉还行。本想用 DMIT 的，发现有货的太贵了。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18093937\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/cf88a6ab471e59aa645a1a7322f56a31?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"testcgd\" data-uid=\"118186\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>8</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/testcgd\">testcgd</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-16 23:13:43 +08:00\">19h 5m ago via Android</span> \n                    \n                    <p>上了灵车，漂移吧</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18093939\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/cb7e/d3ff/714531_normal.png?m=1761119463\" alt=\"V2Try\" data-uid=\"714531\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>9</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/V2Try\">V2Try</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-16 23:15:17 +08:00\">19h 3m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>最夸张的是有一次机房被黑，全部用户数据丢失</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18093947\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/fe6a807d9d5e26ce01705a1cd025aef0?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"alamaya\" data-uid=\"174482\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>10</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/alamaya\">alamaya</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-16 23:21:23 +08:00\">18h 57m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>这家客服回复很慢的，也基本不会有啥补偿，但应该会给你重新开一台</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18093952\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/f637/e9a6/353999_normal.png?m=1542094157\" alt=\"sanshiliu\" data-uid=\"353999\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>11</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/sanshiliu\">sanshiliu</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-16 23:24:37 +08:00\">18h 54m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>别用了，之前数据全丢了也没什么补偿，然后前两个月无缘无故又要换我的 ip</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18093994\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/3c2acd7d4430c57e93f3dd4dc6448a42?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"jetsung\" data-uid=\"779164\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>12</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/jetsung\">jetsung</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-17 00:04:50 +08:00\">18h 13m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>colocrossing 的稳定，但是，IP 老是进墙，特别是移动墙。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18094030\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/bedf/40df/438004_normal.png?m=1786379099\" alt=\"docx\" data-uid=\"438004\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>13</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/docx\">docx</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-17 00:45:09 +08:00\">17h 33m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>一分钱一分货，选择了这个价位就要做好心理准备</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18094069\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/a482/1eca/441309_normal.png?m=1780562089\" alt=\"Jianrry\" data-uid=\"441309\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>14</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Jianrry\">Jianrry</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-17 02:14:13 +08:00\">16h 4m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>有一次 CloudCone 服务器突然关机，持续时间多达数个小时。</p><p>客服说服务器所在区域发生了故障，我的服务器被强制关机了。</p><p>事实是发生故障的区域是另一个区域，我的服务器被人工错误地关闭了。</p><p>我意识到 CloudCone 完全是一个草台班子，这件事发生之后就删掉了账号。</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18094127\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/4f6a/ce64/802458_normal.png?m=1789220856\" alt=\"fred986\" data-uid=\"802458\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>15</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/fred986\">fred986</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-17 07:29:54 +08:00\">10h 48m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我还在坚持使用，比较 2c 2g 120g 一年才$15 ，设置了每日备份到甲骨文，年初数据丢失确实是个教训</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18094153\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/804d/e559/351325_normal.png?m=1789609551\" alt=\"qwwuyu\" data-uid=\"351325\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>16</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/qwwuyu\">qwwuyu</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-17 08:10:52 +08:00\">10h 7m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>2c2g120G $14.99 的丢了，一个月赔偿价和 2 个月续费期都没用，因为 ip 被邻居送中了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18094200\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/b5d4/adb2/12854_normal.png?m=1769045988\" alt=\"everyx\" data-uid=\"12854\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>19</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/everyx\">everyx</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-17 08:38:14 +08:00\">9h 40m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>等服务到期也打算退了，太草台班子了，经常宕机</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18094222\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/grava